local GATE={[1]=1,[23]=25,[66]=51,[103]=70,[144]=93,[176]=107,[226]=134,[279]=161,[324]=193,[348]=209,[382]=229,[424]=261,[461]=281,[513]=308,[568]=330,[592]=347,[630]=366,[655]=385}
function koWujeNativePID(pid) local p=ID[pid] if p==nil then return pid end return p or nil end
local links={}
for _,r in ipairs(koLinkPairs) do
 local a,b=koWujeNativePID(r[1]),koWujeNativePID(r[2])
 if a and b then links[#links+1]={a,b,r[3],r[4],r[5]} end
end
koLinkPairs=links
for bz,owners in pairs(koBZOwner) do
 local out={}
 for _,pid in ipairs(owners) do local p=koWujeNativePID(pid) if p then out[#out+1]=p end end
 koBZOwner[bz]=out
end
local hires={}
koExtraEv={}
for _,r in ipairs(koExtraHire) do
 local pid=koWujeNativePID(r[1])
 local valid=pid~=nil local req=r[4]
 if type(req)=="table" then
  local out={req[1],req[2]}
  for i=3,#req do local p=koWujeNativePID(req[i]) if p then out[#out+1]=p else valid=false end end
  req=out
 elseif type(req)=="number" then req=koWujeNativePID(req) valid=valid and req~=nil end
 if valid then
  local gate=r[2]==0 and 0 or GATE[r[2]]
  assert(gate,"Unknown native story gate")
  hires[#hires+1]={pid,gate,r[3],req} koExtraEv[pid]=r[3]
 end
end
koExtraHire=hires

